ory collection, per_page=100; an empty collection establishes only absence of published entries in this collection.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server/security/advisories/GHSA-pjp5-fpmr-3349\",\n      \"collection_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/github/github-mcp-server/security-advisories?per_page=100\",\n      \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-26T10:13:34.559933+00:00\",\n      \"published_at\": \"2026-06-09T09:15:58Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-06-09T09:15:58Z\",\n      \"advisory_id\": \"GHSA-pjp5-fpmr-3349\",\n      \"cve_id\": \"CVE-2026-48529\",\n      \"title\": \"Lockdown mode singleton in HTTP server causes cross-user GraphQL client confusion\",\n      \"severity\": \"medium\",\n      \"vulnerabilities\": [\n        {\n          \"package\": {\n            \"ecosystem\": \"go\",\n            \"name\": \"github.com/github/github-mcp-server\"\n          },\n          \"vulnerable_version_range\": \">= 0.22.0, < 1.1.2\",\n          \"patched_versions\": \"1.1.2\",\n          \"vulnerable_functions\": []\n        }\n      ],\n      \"excerpt\": \"Summary When running in HTTP mode with --lockdown-mode enabled, the RepoAccessCache is implemented as a process-global singleton initialized with the\",\n      \"maintainer_guidance_summary\": \"HTTP deployments using --lockdown-mode share the first authenticated user\\u2019s GraphQL client across users. Advisory patch field: 1.1.2.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/github/github-mcp-server/security/advisories/GHSA-w4q6-qw23-4rg7\",\n      \"collection_url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/github/github-mcp-server/security-advisories?per_page=100\",\n      \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-26T10:13:34.559933+00:00\",\n      \"published_at\": \"2026-07-20T12:01:42Z\",\n      \"updated_at\": \"2026-07-20T12:01:42Z\",\n      \"advisory_id\": \"GHSA-w4q6-qw23-4rg7\",\n      \"cve_id\": \"CVE-2026-47427\",\n      \"title\": \"Nil Pointer Dereference DoS in completion/complete Handler\",\n      \"severity\": \"high\",\n      \"vulnerabilities\": [\n        {\n          \"package\": {\n            \"ecosystem\": \"go\",\n            \"name\": \"github.com/github/github-mcp-server\"\n          },\n          \"vulnerable_version_range\": \"<= 0.33.0 (also affects latest main)\",\n          \"patched_versions\": \"\",\n          \"vulnerable_functions\": []\n        }\n      ],\n      \"excerpt\": \"Summary A nil pointer dereference vulnerability in the GitHub MCP Server causes it to crash when receiving a malformed completion/complete\",\n      \"maintainer_guidance_summary\": \"Malformed completion/complete input can panic before authentication. Patched-version field is empty; advisory suggests validating params and ref. Its \\u201clatest main\\u201d wording is historical advisory text, not a verified statement about today\\u2019s main.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/makenotion/notion-mcp-server/security-advisories?per_page=100\",\n      \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-26T10:13:34.838811+00:00\",\n      \"published_at\": null,\n      \"updated_at\": null,\n      \"published_advisory_count\": 0,\n      \"query_scope\": \"Public maintainer repository advisory collection, per_page=100; an empty collection establishes only absence of published entries in this collection.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://api.github.com/repos/modelcontextprotocol/servers/security-advisories?per_page=100\",\n      \"retrieved_at\": \"2026-10-26T10:13:35.440062+00:00\",\n      \"published_at\": null,\n      \"updated_at\": null,\n      \"published_advisory_count\": 14,\n      \"query_scope\": \"Public maintainer repository advisory collection, per_page=100; an empty collection establishes only absence of published entries in this collection.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/servers/security/advisories/GHSA-3jqg-r5pp-rmp2\",\n      \"collection_url\": \"https://api.githu